  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As you channel, orcs around you rise to the occasion with renewed vigor.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Foment the Blood<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Foment the Blood, add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the bonuses granted by the feat. You may expend one use of mythic power to heal all orcs within range a number of hit points equal to your mythic tier plus the number of dice of healing you normally provide when channeling energy.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc158\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
